WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.050
Los Angeles, 7 January 2025.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.610
At 10:30 in the morning,
the Palisades fire starts.

3
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:12.550
At 6:18 that evening, across the
county, the Eaton fire starts.

4
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.190
Both are contained on 31
January, after 24 days.

5
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:21.370
Together, they cover about
152 square kilometres.

6
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.010
The houses are only the first loss.

7
00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:27.410
What else does a city lose,
and how do people recover?

8
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.290
In this mission, you'll
sort the fires' impacts,

9
00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.190
from the first hours to
the years that follow.

10
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:37.710
Then you'll judge the responses,
from evacuation to federal aid.

11
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:41.030
Your mission: evaluate what
a city loses to wildfire,

12
00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.230
and how its people can recover.
